        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.6.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yabo 6.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man aye gin ma Rwot Lubaŋa tye ka wacone ni, “At ye ki can aŋwen ma abicwalo i kom Jerucalem, lweny, kec, lee tim-gu ki two gemo, wek onek dano woko ducu kacel ki lee ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka ce inen ŋat mo obwot obedo kwo ce olaro litinone, ka gubino botwu myero wunengi. Ci wubineno kit ma kitgi ki gin ma gitimo ducu rac kwede, man miyo wubiye ni can ma abiketo i kom Jerucalem tye kakare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
